<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed sharply higher Monday in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 42.72 to 7478.50, a record.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 2.04 to 450.17, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.19.</p>
<p>Advancers outpaced decliners 1,414 to 1,087.</p>
<p>Volume was 465,573,920 compared with 488,349,130 on Friday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
